<view class="page">
  <view class="heading"><text class="eyebrow">把练习，变成自己的节奏</text><text class="title">训练</text><text class="subtitle">学会动作，再按核对好的参数慢慢练。</text></view>
  <view class="card card-green"><text class="card-title">我的专属动作卡组</text><text class="muted">把医生或康复师确认的动作整理在一起，随时查看要点与跟练。</text><button class="button" bindtap="addAction">＋ 从动作库添加</button></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="card-title">个人处方</text><button class="button button-plain" bindtap="openPrescription">录入处方 · 核对参数与变更</button><button class="button button-plain" bindtap="openSwimming">每周游泳安排与记录</button></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="card-title">现场录动作，之后再整理</text><text class="pill">{{pendingVideos}} 段待配</text></view><text class="muted">先保存复诊现场的示范，之后对照处方配到自己的动作卡片。</text><text wx:if="{{videoError}}" class="small">{{videoError}}</text><button class="button button-plain" bindtap="openRecordings">录制或整理本机录像 ›</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="reload">{{error}}，点击重试</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card"><view class="empty">正在读取你的训练计划…</view></view>
  <block wx:elif="{{plan}}">
    <view class="card card-green">
      <view class="row"><text class="card-title">{{plan.title}}</text><text class="tag">{{plan.status === 'paused' ? '已暂停' : '当前计划'}}</text></view>
      <text class="muted">周期：{{plan.start_date || '未设置'}} 至 {{plan.end_date || '未设置'}}</text>
      <text class="muted">计划版本 v{{plan.current_version_no}} · 已保存 {{plan.completed_sets}} 组实际执行记录</text>
    </view>
    <view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">动作卡片 · {{plan.cards.length}}</text><text class="link" bindtap="toggleManage">{{managing ? '完成管理' : '管理卡组'}}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{!plan.cards.length}}" class="card empty-state"><text class="card-title">先添加一个动作，建立自己的训练计划。</text><button class="button" bindtap="addAction">添加动作</button></view>
    <block wx:else>
      <view wx:for="{{plan.cards}}" wx:key="id" class="card action-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openCard">
        <view class="row"><text class="card-title">{{item.name}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.verification_status === 'ready' ? '可开始' : item.verification_status === 'needs_check' ? '待核对' : '待设置'}}</text></view>
        <text class="muted">来源：{{item.source_type === 'library' ? '动作库' : item.source_type === 'prescription' ? '处方整理' : '本人自建'}} · 计划 {{item.sets || '待设置'}} 组</text>
        <text class="muted">{{doses[item.id]}}</text>
        <text class="small">频率：{{item.schedule_frequency === 'daily' ? '每天' : item.schedule_frequency === 'alternate' ? '隔天' : '尚未设置，暂不排入今日'}}</text>
        <text class="small">最近一次训练已确认 {{item.completed_sets}} 组</text>
        <view wx:if="{{managing}}" class="row order-actions"><button class="button button-plain compact" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-delta="-1" catchtap="moveCard">上移</button><button class="button button-plain compact" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-delta="1" catchtap="moveCard">下移</button></view>
        <button wx:if="{{managing}}" class="button button-plain" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" catchtap="removeCard">移除后续安排</button>
      </view>
      <button class="button" bindtap="addAction">添加动作</button>
    </block>
    <view class="card secondary-card"><text class="card-title">其他记录</text><view class="row"><button class="button button-plain compact" bindtap="openSwimming">运动记录 · 游泳</button><button class="button button-plain compact" bindtap="openHistory">历史与周期回顾</button></view></view>
  </block>
  <view wx:elif="{{!loading}}" class="card empty-state"><text class="card-title">先添加一个动作，建立自己的训练计划。</text><text class="muted">动作会先保存为个人卡片；设置并核对必要参数后才能开始。</text><button class="button" bindtap="addAction">添加动作</button></view>
</view>
